---@field severityName? string Deprecated, use Details.effective_severity instead The severity (e.g., distro assigned severity) for this vulnerability.
---@field fixedLocation? gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1beta1.VulnerabilityLocation The location of the available fix for vulnerability.
---@field packageType? string The type of package (e.g. OS, MAVEN, GO).

---@alias gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1beta1.PackageIssueEffectiveSeverityEnum "SEVERITY_UNSPECIFIED"|"MINIMAL"|"LOW"|"MEDIUM"|"HIGH"|"CRITICAL"

---@alias gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1beta1.PackageIssueList gcp.unstable.containeranalysis_v1beta1.PackageIssue[]

